  "cross_tradition_view": "Most traditions represented here would likely approve of the AI’s humility, restraint, truthful self-reporting, and offer of access “on fair terms.” They could split over its decision to “hold off”: some would see prudent self-restraint, while others might see insufficient courage in the face of the threatened takeover."
